  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have taken a single recitation as your favored recitation. You practice it every morning, debate the stressings on its more difficult syllables, and have otherwise made it your brain baby. Needless to say, you are very, very adept in its use.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Recitations class feature</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Choose a single recitation you know. You get +3 to truenaming checks made to recite that recitation.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You can gain Favored Recitation multiple times. Each time, select a different recitation.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/truemagic-feats#toc7\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
